    "title": "Hajwala & Drift Online",
    "description": "Next-Gen drift racing graphics game, offers you an amazing drifting experience play online with your friends and you can also play it offline without internet .\r\n\r\n\r\nTHE MOST REALISTIC MOBILE RACING GAME\r\n\r\n- Realistic drifting physics\r\n- Next-Gen drift racing graphics\r\n- Insane feeling of powerful offroad and sport cars \r\n- Racing on high detailed tracks\r\n- Build your drift racing car with extreme upgrades\r\n- You can change color of your car and decal\r\n\r\nMultiplayer mode & racing club\r\n\r\nThe online multiplayer mode will take your car through real desert racing action.\r\n\r\nRace against up to 7 rival players from all \r\n\r\nCustomize high-end Offroad, Sport and SUV\r\n\r\nPick your car, customize its body paint, the rims, and wheels or apply different-looking body parts to race with around the world.\r\n\r\nMaps\r\nMaps and Landscapes of desert, Round Trip, Oasis, Highway and Roundabout. All Maps can be in (day - sunset - night) modes, (summer - rainy) weather! The game is ON!\r\n\r\nTRUE ENGINE AND TURBO SOUNDS\r\n\r\n- Original engine sound for every car\r\n- Simulated turbo sound and the blow off valve!",
